   "text": "Kaplan Business School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKaplan Business School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nKaplan Business School is a global leader in providing affordable higher education business degrees in Australia.\nOur unique offering focuses on maximising outcomes for our students:\n- Small class sizes – more individual support and a stronger connection with your peers\n- Expert teachers with real-world experience – gain industry-relevant insights, not just knowledge\n- Innovative course delivery – we think how you learn is as important as what you learn\n- Practical subjects – build a skill set employers are looking for\n- Outstanding student support – from dedicated student experience officers to our globally recognised careers service, you’ll find the personal, academic and careers support you need\nWe offer a diverse range of undergraduate and postgraduate courses in business, accounting, information technology, marketing, management, tourism, entrepreneurship, health services, digital management, analytics, project management and leadership.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n02/04/2026 11:14\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n02/04/2026 11:14\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$58,800.00\nMin: A$11,600.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n23%\n1,633 of 7,100 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2008\nCampus(es)\nAdelaide\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Fiji, India, Kiribati, Micronesia, Nauru, Nepal, New Zealand, Pakistan, Palau\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n02/01/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation 